<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.5000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.5000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.1500 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 18		 July 17</p>
<p> High			     75.5500		 75.1500</p>
<p> Low				75.2101		 75.1000</p>
<p> Open			     75.2101		 75.1200</p>
<p> Close			    75.5000		 75.1500</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    1.415		   7.295</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
